00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:33.740
Before we go, Starship Flight 13 remains the clearest

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.940
near-term test of whether incremental hardware changes

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:39.240
can deliver measurable reuse gains.

